    "name": "Immortum",
    "steam_appid": 3484010,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immortum is inspired by Signalis, F.E.A.R, Stasis and Soma and brings a blend of spooky environments and mind bending storytelling. Can you find out the truth before your lives run out and your save file is deleted?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/a399d37d3cadbb696fc7480dea4d1a6a.poster.avif?t=1752569617\" width=800 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/a399d37d3cadbb696fc7480dea4d1a6a.webm?t=1752569617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/bd57256dd115bbbfcb6b6b4edef0daf7.poster.avif?t=1752569617\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/bd57256dd115bbbfcb6b6b4edef0daf7.webm?t=1752569617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/bd57256dd115bbbfcb6b6b4edef0daf7.mp4?t=1752569617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you die, your body is recreated through cloning, but that's only half the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your memories are just as important. They are stored as data on a chip,  drilled deep into your brain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Without a chip, you\u2019re a hollow shell; an empty meat suit, lifeless and mindless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And once they run out, it\u2019s <strong>GAME OVER</strong>. Your story is erased from existence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/b3618179b21aebdd5011f8de9d220908.poster.avif?t=1752569617\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/b3618179b21aebdd5011f8de9d220908.webm?t=1752569617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/b3618179b21aebdd5011f8de9d220908.mp4?t=1752569617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way to reclaim brain chips is to find injectors capable of penetrating the skull and extracting a chip from your dead body. Isn\u2019t the cycle of life marvelous?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful - everything comes at a price\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/1d3ba153c5d7ebbae58d7b8fb8f0e72c.poster.avif?t=1752569617\" width=800 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/1d3ba153c5d7ebbae58d7b8fb8f0e72c.webm?t=1752569617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/bf24a97a194b675de1426820c6d83fac.poster.avif?t=1752569617\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/bf24a97a194b675de1426820c6d83fac.webm?t=1752569617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/bf24a97a194b675de1426820c6d83fac.mp4?t=1752569617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save at the comfort of your safe room, or the game will save for you when you <strong>die</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Remember: you have a limited amount of lives!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/dc8b77c4d96e88026d165763fe9286c1.poster.avif?t=1752569617\" width=800 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/dc8b77c4d96e88026d165763fe9286c1.webm?t=1752569617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/38e1cd30a0b962fff88472b1f7d36ea3.poster.avif?t=1752569617\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/38e1cd30a0b962fff88472b1f7d36ea3.webm?t=1752569617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/38e1cd30a0b962fff88472b1f7d36ea3.mp4?t=1752569617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry items in your inventory or store them in the convenience of your safe room. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you die, you can retrieve your items from your dead body - no time limits, no penalties. But remember: every death brings you closer to game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/9ca89857eff9013af1f463bf679e944a.poster.avif?t=1752569617\" width=800 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/9ca89857eff9013af1f463bf679e944a.webm?t=1752569617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/ea863f0960b12a9d69d6f63ff837d34a.poster.avif?t=1752569617\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/ea863f0960b12a9d69d6f63ff837d34a.webm?t=1752569617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/ea863f0960b12a9d69d6f63ff837d34a.mp4?t=1752569617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immortum is inspired by Signalis, F.E.A.R, Stasis and Soma and brings a blend of spooky environments and mind bending storytelling. Can you find out the truth before your lives run out and your save file is deleted?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/a399d37d3cadbb696fc7480dea4d1a6a.poster.avif?t=1752569617\" width=800 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/a399d37d3cadbb696fc7480dea4d1a6a.webm?t=1752569617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/bd57256dd115bbbfcb6b6b4edef0daf7.poster.avif?t=1752569617\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/bd57256dd115bbbfcb6b6b4edef0daf7.webm?t=1752569617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/bd57256dd115bbbfcb6b6b4edef0daf7.mp4?t=1752569617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you die, your body is recreated through cloning, but that's only half the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your memories are just as important. They are stored as data on a chip,  drilled deep into your brain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Without a chip, you\u2019re a hollow shell; an empty meat suit, lifeless and mindless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And once they run out, it\u2019s <strong>GAME OVER</strong>. Your story is erased from existence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/b3618179b21aebdd5011f8de9d220908.poster.avif?t=1752569617\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/b3618179b21aebdd5011f8de9d220908.webm?t=1752569617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/b3618179b21aebdd5011f8de9d220908.mp4?t=1752569617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way to reclaim brain chips is to find injectors capable of penetrating the skull and extracting a chip from your dead body. Isn\u2019t the cycle of life marvelous?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful - everything comes at a price\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/1d3ba153c5d7ebbae58d7b8fb8f0e72c.poster.avif?t=1752569617\" width=800 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/1d3ba153c5d7ebbae58d7b8fb8f0e72c.webm?t=1752569617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/bf24a97a194b675de1426820c6d83fac.poster.avif?t=1752569617\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/bf24a97a194b675de1426820c6d83fac.webm?t=1752569617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/bf24a97a194b675de1426820c6d83fac.mp4?t=1752569617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save at the comfort of your safe room, or the game will save for you when you <strong>die</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Remember: you have a limited amount of lives!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/dc8b77c4d96e88026d165763fe9286c1.poster.avif?t=1752569617\" width=800 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/dc8b77c4d96e88026d165763fe9286c1.webm?t=1752569617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/38e1cd30a0b962fff88472b1f7d36ea3.poster.avif?t=1752569617\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/38e1cd30a0b962fff88472b1f7d36ea3.webm?t=1752569617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/38e1cd30a0b962fff88472b1f7d36ea3.mp4?t=1752569617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry items in your inventory or store them in the convenience of your safe room. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you die, you can retrieve your items from your dead body - no time limits, no penalties. But remember: every death brings you closer to game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/9ca89857eff9013af1f463bf679e944a.poster.avif?t=1752569617\" width=800 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/9ca89857eff9013af1f463bf679e944a.webm?t=1752569617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/ea863f0960b12a9d69d6f63ff837d34a.poster.avif?t=1752569617\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/ea863f0960b12a9d69d6f63ff837d34a.webm?t=1752569617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484010/extras/ea863f0960b12a9d69d6f63ff837d34a.mp4?t=1752569617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Immortum is Psychological Sci-Fi horror with limited lives. Survive a hostile decaying spaceship, escape mind bending traps, and uncover the impossible truth as Romi, a mother desperate to find her dying child. Can you find the answers before your existence is erased?",
